## Payments Rules

- Provide `POST /payments/pay` with provider-agnostic request schema.
- Read provider keys from env (e.g., `PAYMENT_PROVIDER_API_KEY`).
- Implement provider adapters under `services/` (e.g., Stripe, MercadoPago) with a common interface.
- Idempotency: require `idempotency_key` on payment requests; ensure safe retries.
- Log payment events (no PII); return minimal receipt info.
- Timeouts and retries for provider calls (`shared.utils.retry`).
- Webhooks: future work; prepare router placeholder.

